{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流向量数据库对比与选型\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\n请对比主流向量数据库（Chroma、Milvus、Pinecone、Weaviate、Qdrant、pgvector）的特点，并给出选型建议。\n\n## 答案\n\n**主流向量数据库综合对比：**\n\n| 维度 | Chroma | Milvus | Pinecone | Weaviate | Qdrant | pgvector |\n|------|--------|--------|----------|----------|--------|----------|\n| **定位** | 嵌入式/轻量级 | 分布式/云原生 | 全托管 SaaS | 模块化/图数据库 | 开源/高性能 | PostgreSQL 扩展 |\n| **部署方式** | 嵌入式/本地 | 自托管/K8s | 云托管 | 自托管/云托管 | 自托管/云托管 | PostgreSQL 插件 |\n| **扩展性** | 单机 | 水平扩展 | 垂直扩展 | 水平扩展 | 水平扩展 | 依赖 PG |\n| **混合检索** | 基础 | 强 | 强 | 很强 | 强 | 基础 |\n| **适用规模** | &lt;100万 | 亿级+ | &lt;10亿 | &lt;10亿 | &lt;10亿 | &lt;100万 |\n| **延迟(P99)** | 较高 | &lt;50ms | &lt;100ms | &lt;150ms | &lt;50ms | 较高 |\n| **GPU 加速** | 否 | 是 | 否 | 否 | 否 | 否 |\n| **开源** | 是 | 是 | 否 | 是 | 是 | 是 |\n| **成本** | 免费 | 免费+运维 | $70+/月 | 免费+云服务 | 免费+云服务 | 免费 |\n| **运维复杂度** | 极低 | 高 | 极低 | 中 | 低 | 低 |\n\n**各数据库详细特点：**\n\n**Chroma**\n```python\n# Chroma：最简单的入门选择\nimport chromadb\n\nclient = chromadb.Client()\ncollection = client.create_collection(\"my_docs\")\n\ncollection.add(\n    documents=[\"doc1 content\", \"doc2 content\"],\n    ids=[\"id1\", \"id2\"]\n)\n\nresults = collection.query(\n    query_texts=[\"query\"],\n    n_results=5\n)\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：pip install 即可用，API 极简，适合快速原型</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">缺点：单机性能有限，不适合大规模生产</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Milvus</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：分布式架构，亿级向量毫秒级响应，GPU 加速</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">缺点：运维复杂，需要 K8s 经验</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">适用：大规模生产环境、技术实力强的团队</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Pinecone</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> pinecone <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Pinecone\n\npc <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Pinecone<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>api_key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"your-key\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nindex <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> pc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Index<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"my-index\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nindex<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>upsert<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>vectors<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"id1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0.1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"key\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"value\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nresults <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>vector<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0.1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：全托管零运维，API 简洁</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">缺点：闭源，按量计费可能成本高</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">适用：无运维团队、快速上线</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Weaviate</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：内置图数据库能力，混合搜索强，多模态支持</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">缺点：上手门槛略高</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">适用：知识图谱场景、多模态检索</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Qdrant</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：开源 Rust 实现，性能优秀，自托管友好</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">适用：需要高性能且希望自托管的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>pgvector</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-sql\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-sql is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\">-- pgvector：PostgreSQL 扩展</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">CREATE</span> EXTENSION vector<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">CREATE</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">TABLE</span> items <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>id bigserial <span class=\"token keyword\">PRIMARY</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">KEY</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> embedding vector<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1536</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">-- 插入数据</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">INSERT</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">INTO</span> items <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">VALUES</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'[1,2,3,...]'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">-- 相似度查询</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> items \n<span class=\"token keyword\">ORDER</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">BY</span> embedding <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token string\">'[1,2,3,...]'</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">-- 欧氏距离</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">LIMIT</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优点：零额外成本，与现有 PG 数据共存</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">缺点：性能不如专用向量数据库</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">适用：已有 PostgreSQL、数据量不大的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>选型决策树：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">数据规模?\n├── &lt;100万\n│   ├── 已有 PostgreSQL ──▶ pgvector\n│   ├── 快速原型 ──▶ Chroma\n│   └── 生产环境 ──▶ Qdrant / Weaviate\n│\n├── 100万-1亿\n│   ├── 无运维团队 ──▶ Pinecone\n│   ├── 知识图谱 ──▶ Weaviate\n│   └── 自托管 ──▶ Qdrant / Milvus\n│\n└── &gt;1亿\n    ├── 分布式需求 ──▶ Milvus\n    └── 全托管 ──▶ Pinecone\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 百万级向量应该用哪个？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 推荐优先级：Qdrant &gt; Weaviate &gt; pgvector（已有PG）。百万级不需要 Milvus 的分布式能力，Qdrant 单机性能足够且运维简单。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 向量数据库的成本主要由什么决定？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 1) 存储量：向量数量 × 维度 × 4字节（float32）；2) 查询量：QPS 越高成本越高；3) 运维成本：自托管需要运维人力。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Chroma 不适合生产</strong> — Chroma 在百万级以下可以生产使用，但超过后性能下降</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Pinecone 一定最贵</strong> — 小规模场景 Pinecone 的免费额度够用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>一个数据库解决所有问题</strong> — 复杂场景可能需要组合使用</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q12&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q12: 什么是 GraphRAG？它解决了什么问题？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q12: 什么是 GraphRAG？它解决了什么问题？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}